<title>THAILAND: Samart Telcoms 1996 net profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Samart Telcoms 1996 net profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results</p>
<p>for year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	    2.26	vs	   2.19</p>
<p>    Net		     101.57	vs	  81.28</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Samart Telcoms Plc, a telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
